{"2693560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hlína", "steam_appid": 2693560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693560/extras/1d997b3e83855d136786d1453c63b57d.poster.avif?t=1771872153\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693560/extras/1d997b3e83855d136786d1453c63b57d.webm?t=1771872153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693560/extras/1d997b3e83855d136786d1453c63b57d.mp4?t=1771872153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Hlína, a game set in a unique town entirely made of clay, you play as Ollie, who is trying to take care of his mum after she lost her job. The town's factory is demanding more work from its people, making life harder for Ollie and his mum. The game blends everyday life problems with spooky mysteries. As you explore, you uncover secrets and face challenges. The town, crafted from clay, gives the game a distinct and captivating look. You'll see how Ollie navigates real-life troubles while also encountering scary surprises hidden within the town. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693560/extras/dff7b4a8c3e27fc0c0052b2e8c8795ac.poster.avif?t=1771872153\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693560/extras/dff7b4a8c3e27fc0c0052b2e8c8795ac.webm?t=1771872153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693560/extras/dff7b4a8c3e27fc0c0052b2e8c8795ac.mp4?t=1771872153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why It's Special:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made of Clay: Everything in the game, from houses to people, is made of clay. This makes it look different from other games with unique atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Story About Real Life: The game tells a story about Ollie trying to help his mum and deal with life's hard bits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore: You'll get to look around the town, see places, explore, and interact.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spooky Feel: The game has a creepy side, with the scary parts of real life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Score: The music in Hlína is just as special as its visuals. With an original score that captures the mood of every moment, from quiet, tender scenes to the heart-pounding ones, the music will pull you deeper into the world of Hlína.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames: Variety of minigames that reflect Ollie's everyday.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693560/extras/b2bea6f75a384d1dc4d57e20ce58bb7c.poster.avif?t=1771872153\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693560/extras/b2bea6f75a384d1dc4d57e20ce58bb7c.webm?t=1771872153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2693560/extras/b2bea6f75a384d1dc4d57e20ce58bb7c.mp4?t=1771872153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=